# Server-Side Document Vision Extraction (Stored in Supabase Edge Function Secrets)
# Do NOT put secret keys in this frontend environment file.
# Set the Gemini API key in your Supabase project using the Supabase CLI:
#   supabase secrets set GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key
# Or in Supabase Dashboard: Project Settings -> Edge Functions -> Secrets -> Add GEMINI_API_KEY
